cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this software and the upstream MVPDR, CLIP, DINOv3, PlantSeg, and dataset papers when used.
title: "Lesion-Aware Open-Set Plant Disease Recognition: Extension of ACM MM'24 MVPDR"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A cleaned reproducible implementation/reconstruction of academic project work carried out from
  September to November 2025, combining CLIP prototypes, frozen DINOv3 dense features, lesion
  supervision, gated fusion, and open-set rejection. Repository creation metadata is intentionally
  separate from the academic project period.
authors:
  - name: Project contributors
